<br>
YAAD AAGAYE SABKO BA KHUDA HYDER-E-KARRAR LARZE DARODIWAAR,<br>
 JAB SHAAM KE DARBAR MEIN TUNE DIYA QUDBA AAYE SANIYE ZEHRA<br>
<br>
JIS BACCHI KE SARWAR THE SADA NAAZ UTHA TE SEENE PA SULATE,<br>
 DAM TODH TE TUNE USSE ZINDAAN MAIN DEKHA AAYE SANIYE ZEHRA<br>
